### Contest result - already contested (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/2/contest
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenResponsible}}

### Contest result - result not pending (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/3/contest
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenResponsible}}

### Contest result - match not found (should return 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/999/contest
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenResponsible}}

### Contest result - unauthorized (should return 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/1/contest
